     1590   DO:
     1591     if ( available X_c-obj-hist ) then do:
     1592       if ( v-rid-list = "" ) or b-mark:sensitive = no
     1593       then
     1594       v-rid-list = string( recid( X_c-obj-hist ) ) .
     1595     end.
     1596   END.
     1597   ON MOUSE-SELECT-DBLCLICK OF br-obj-hist IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
