     3154     then do:
     3155       ASSIGN
     3156         sch-corr-date :POPUP-MENU in frame Dialog-Frame = MENU m-ed-date22 :HANDLE
     3157         sch-corr-date :MENU-MOUSE in frame Dialog-Frame = 3
     3158       .
