     3424             sch-corr-user-name mark-num
     3425         WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     3426     ENABLE b-quit B-mark b-sel v-corr-user-db-num B-print B-sch
     3427            B-Help br-obj-hist sch-db-num sch-corr-date sch-obj-code
     3428            sch-corr-user-name BR-changes mark-num b-nextlevel
