     3477   b-nextlevel
     3478   WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     3479   VIEW FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     3480   HIDE sch-corr-user-name IN FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     3481   END PROCEDURE.
     3482   PROCEDURE OpenBr :
     3483   define input  parameter p-open-query     as logical   no-undo .
     3484   define input  parameter p-find-next      as logical   no-undo .
     3485   define input  parameter p-find-condition as character no-undo .
