     3604           .
     3605       end.
     3606     end.
     3607     if l-filter-open-27 = false then do:
     3608       OPEN QUERY br-obj-hist FOR EACH X_c-obj-hist
     3609         where  TRUE
     3610          BY X_c-obj-hist.corr-date DESC BY X_c-obj-hist.corr-time DESC
     3611          BY X_c-obj-hist.corr-date DESC BY X_c-obj-hist.corr-time DESC
     3612         indexed-reposition
     3613     .
